  "description": "DICOMweb (PS3.18) server building blocks for ASP.NET Core on Plgic.Dicom: app.MapDicomWeb() maps QIDO-RS, WADO-RS (instances, metadata, frames, bulk data) and STOW-RS minimal-API endpoints over a pluggable IDicomWebStore, with streaming multipart, content negotiation and request size limits. Includes in-memory and file-system reference stores. Requires a license key: free Developer key for development and testing, Pro / Enterprise plans for production (https://dicomkit.plogic.dev).",
